# AOI-A — DINOv2 ONNX models directory (default AI_DINOV2_MODEL_PATH root).
#
# Drop a real DINOv2 ONNX here as dinov2.onnx (the default configured path) to
# activate the "onnx" embedding tier. Absent → the pipeline degrades HONESTLY to
# text-of-image (GGUF) or heuristic and labels the tier; it NEVER fabricates vectors.
#
# Override the path with AI_DINOV2_MODEL_PATH (absolute or repo-relative).
# Model binaries are gitignored (*.onnx) and MUST NOT be committed.
